abstract: >-
  A bilingual, deduplicated bibliography of pediatric and adult literature,
  expert consensus statements, and clinical guidelines on anomalous aortic
  origin of a coronary artery. Non-full-text access cards are explicitly
  identified and link to DOI, PMID, or original source entries.
